---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Mane Bangla Dictionary – English to Bangla App
description: Mane is a modern offline English-to-Bangla and Bangla-to-English dictionary for Android with Banglish search, Study Scan, examples, and vocabulary practice.
schemaKey: homepage
bodyClass: home-page
permalink: index.html
scripts:
  - /mane-search.bundle.js
  - /scripts/home.js
styles:
  - /styles/resources.css
faqItems:
  - question: Does Mane work offline?
    answer: Mane is built as an offline English-to-Bangla and Bangla-to-English dictionary for Android. Core lookup and review flows are designed for offline-friendly use, while some platform services may still need internet access.
  - question: Can I search using Banglish?
    answer: Yes. Mane is designed to support Banglish input so users can type Bangla words with English letters instead of switching keyboards or search modes for every lookup.
  - question: What is Study Scan?
    answer: Study Scan helps users capture textbook or study words, check meanings, and save useful vocabulary for later review and practice.
  - question: Why choose Mane over other dictionary apps?
    answer: Many dictionary apps make you choose English-to-Bangla or Bangla-to-English mode before searching. Mane is built for faster lookup with Banglish search, offline-friendly use, Study Scan, and vocabulary practice in one app.
  - question: Where can I find privacy and account-deletion guidance?
    answer: Use the Privacy Policy and Account Deletion pages on this website for official guidance.
